1
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,920
Then why is it that as soon as he arrives,

2
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:37,440
everything goes wrong?

3
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:40,800
I lost my post as head of the Operations and Training Section.

4
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,840
And how is Lao Jiang any worse than him?

5
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,960
His position in the main attack battalion is gone too.

6
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,000
And you.

7
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:51,520
How long do you plan to stay in the position

8
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:53,160
of Deputy Brigade Commander?

9
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:56,240
So you wrote the report letter,

10
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:57,120
right?

11
00:01:58,880 --> 00:01:59,760
To put it plainly,

12
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:02,320
isn't it still about face?

13
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:06,480
Or position?

14
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,080
Is there anything wrong with that?

15
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:11,240
As the old saying goes,

16
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:14,320
A soldier who doesn't want to be a general is not a good soldier.

17
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:14,800
Right?

18
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,800
I've been in the army for so many years.

19
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:20,920
Even if I have no merits,

20
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,960
I've at least put in the hard work.

21
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,720
So why is it that

22
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,880
I can't be promoted when it's time?

23
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,200
I want to advance.

24
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:30,720
I want to serve the army better.

25
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,640
Am I wrong?

26
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,240
Wangyuan.

27
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:40,000
When you were transferred to the Administration Section,

28
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,280
I was the one who proposed it.

29
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:46,200
It was a really hard decision to make.

30
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:51,200
You and Jiang Shengqiang are both soldiers I trained.

31
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:55,160
Do you think I don't want you to advance?

32
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,720
But I hope even more

33
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:03,320
that you are open and honorable.

34
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:06,560
Fair and square.

35
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,760
In your first year as a soldier,

36
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:15,600
one of your comrades was injured.

37
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:18,320
You carried him on your back

38
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:21,160
over several mountains,

39
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,760
with blisters all over your feet.

40
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,320
But you didn't utter a single complaint.

41
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,400
When I was the Battalion Commander,

42
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,280
you were a Company Commander.

43
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,280
Remember?

44
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,520
For the exercise,

45
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,960
and to figure out tactics,

46
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,880
you didn't sleep for three days and nights.

47
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,480
As soon as the exercise ended,

48
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:43,400
you collapsed straight to the ground.

49
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:48,280
Where did the old Liu Wangyuan go?

50
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:50,840
Now you spend all day

51
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:51,720
eyeing this position,

52
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:52,720
eyeing that position.

53
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:56,880
Your head is full of titles.

54
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,360
When I welcomed the new recruits,

55
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,360
I asked all of you,

56
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,520
why did you join the army?

57
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,360
Defend home and country.

58
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:20,480
You were the only one who left a deep impression on me.

59
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:23,120
Your eyes

60
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:25,760
were the most resolute,

61
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:27,440
and the most sincere.

62
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:33,160
Both eyes were filled with the desire to be a soldier.

63
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,520
Why are you like this today?

64
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,800
Search your heart,

65
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,760
did you originally join the army just for this?

66
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,040
To put it plainly,

67
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,480
it's all my fault.

68
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:07,480
Over the years, I've strayed off track.

69
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,800
I didn't set a good example for you.

70
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:12,600
Alright then.

71
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,560
Everything you say is right.

72
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,000
I acknowledge all the flaws you mentioned.

73
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,760
But that has absolutely nothing to do with you.

74
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:22,080
If anyone is leaving, it's me, not you.

75
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,680
Stop saying things in anger.

76
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,000
To tell you the truth,

77
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,280
before Guo Zijian came,

78
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,720
I had never realized

79
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,920
my own problems.

80
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,880
I thought that I, Suo Jian'an,

81
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,760
going from a regular soldier

82
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,720
to Deputy Brigade Commander,

83
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:46,560
had worked conscientiously all the way.

84
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,440
I hadn't made a single mistake.

85
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,960
I was true to my conscience.

86
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,240
I was worthy of this uniform.

87
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:58,200
I lived up to

88
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:01,760
the earnest expectations of my father.

89
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:07,880
But after Guo Zijian arrived,

90
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,800
he was like a mirror,

91
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:14,680
like a mirror placed right in front of me.

92
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,840
I had no choice but to face myself.

93
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:25,400
I never considered myself a conservative person.

94
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,120
How did I

95
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,520
end up

96
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,480
falling behind along the way?

97
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:34,840
His strengths

98
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:39,600
are as glaring as reflections on a mirror,

99
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:44,200
forcing me to face myself.

100
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,080
What highlights?

101
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:47,840
What reflections?

102
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:48,400
What mirror?

103
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,600
I'll smash that mirror of his!

104
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,240
Setting aside whether you should smash it,

105
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:52,840
let me tell you this.

106
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:55,640
Even if you smash Guo Zijian,

107
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:56,720
there will be a second one,

108
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:57,560
and a third.

109
00:06:57,960 --> 00:07:00,240
You don't necessarily need a civilian transfer.

110
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,680
