115
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,480
Li Songwei,

116
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,320
a Company Commander,

117
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:19,360
could sacrifice himself for the military reform.

118
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:21,120
Am I, Suo Jian'an,

119
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,000
