120
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,120
It's time to go.

121
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:39,480
I still don't get it.

122
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,360
Take your time thinking about it then.

123
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,120
The two of us

124
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:53,520
will have fewer and fewer chances to confide in each other.

125
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,600
Remember my words,

126
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,560
