127
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:02,960
I'll be waiting.

128
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:37,360
No.

129
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:40,640
I won't let you leave the army, no matter what.

130
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:45,080
Xiao Liu!

131
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:47,120
Yes, sir!

132
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:48,000
Let's go.

133
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:49,680
Come with me to the Group Army Headquarters.

134
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,160
Yes, sir!

135
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,680
That's why people

136
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:28,080
must continuously learn

137
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,000
to improve

138
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,160
and transform themselves.

139
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:31,240
Otherwise,

140
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,880
they'll only be left behind by the times.

141
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:34,160
Lao Suo,

142
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,680
we're all just

143
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:39,040
