144
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,520
I understand how you feel.

145
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,120
Section Chief Liu

146
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:21,560
The rain is too heavy.

147
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,880
I can't see the road at all.

148
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:25,120
