154
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:33,840
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo is there.

155
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,600
It should be fine.

156
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:35,960
We can't be careless about safety.

157
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:37,360
I'll feel better watching it myself.

158
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,080
Let's go.

159
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:38,720
Check, please.

160
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,640
I already paid. Let's go.

161
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:43,560
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo!

162
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,320
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo!

163
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,280
Reporting.

164
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:47,200
Come in.

165
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:49,960
