178
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,040
The Technical Reconnaissance Detachment

179
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,480
and the Electronic Warfare Detachment's warehouse.

180
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,000
Let's go.

181
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,120
We'll go take a look.

182
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:17,760
Sir.

183
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:19,240
I'll go. You need to evacuate immediately.

184
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,280
Cut the nonsense. Let's go.

185
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:21,240
Yes, sir.

186
00:11:35,520 --> 00:11:36,280
