187
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:36,760
Yes, sir.

188
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:47,680
Staff Officer Liang!

189
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:48,800
The ground is slippery. Be careful.

190
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:51,240
Careful.

191
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:51,880
Be careful.

192
00:11:51,880 --> 00:11:52,440
Watch out.

193
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,200
