199
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:11,360
Staff Officer Liang!

200
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,240
Help him out.

201
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:12,680
Got it.

202
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:13,680
