231
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,240
Follow orders!

232
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:00,440
Zeng Muhan!

233
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:00,680
Yes, sir!

234
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:01,480
