243
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:38,680
Move.

244
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:44,520
Move.

245
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:57,960
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo!

246
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:06,480
What's going on?

247
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,240
What's going on?

248
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:13,880
Who's speaking?

249
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:14,760
What happened?

250
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:16,400
Jiang Shengqiang!

251
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:17,520
Jiang Shengqiang!

252
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:19,440
Where were you?

253
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:20,840
Where were you?

254
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:22,080
Where were you?

255
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,320
Guo Zijian!

256
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:33,920
You're the Battalion Commander.

257
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:35,920
Why didn't you save him?

258
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:43,360
What the hell were all of you doing?

259
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:58,280
Bro.

260
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,800
Bro.

261
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:44,160
Bro.

262
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:47,680
What you said to me last night,

263
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:50,560
I remember it all.

264
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:52,800
Your kindness,

265
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:56,240
I'll repay it in my next life.

266
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,520
I'm taking you home.

267
00:17:25,760 --> 00:17:27,400
Attention!

268
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,760
