269
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:35,560
Salute!

270
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:28,360
Staff Officer Liang.

271
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:30,640
Do you think...

272
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:34,400
if I hadn't

273
00:18:36,320 --> 00:18:38,160
insisted on saving that equipment,

274
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:40,880
he wouldn't have...

275
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:43,200
Staff Officer Liang, it's not your fault.

276
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:43,680
Really.

277
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,520
Esteemed Brigade Party Committee,

278
00:20:47,120 --> 00:20:48,280
With complex

279
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:50,800
yet firm feelings,

280
00:20:52,080 --> 00:20:53,360
I request my discharge.

281
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:58,000
After months of close observation,

282
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:00,240
I am immensely gratified.

283
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:02,680
Gratified by

284
00:21:03,080 --> 00:21:04,320
our cause.

285
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:05,920
Gratified

286
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:08,880
that the younger generation has so excellently

287
00:21:09,360 --> 00:21:11,160
