00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:23,200
desired a promotion

293
00:21:24,080 --> 00:21:26,520
to join the ranks of senior officers.

294
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:29,680
But fortunately,

295
00:21:30,600 --> 00:21:31,720
I gradually came to understand that

296
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,080
even if the organization

297
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:36,000
gave me a position as a favor,

298
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:38,480
I would merely be

299
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:40,400
collecting military pay

300
00:21:41,280 --> 00:21:42,200
and waiting for retirement.

301
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,840
What does that have to do with the Party's cause?

302
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:48,960
Or my original aspiration?

303
00:21:49,480 --> 00:21:51,760
Or what I have always focused on,

304
00:21:51,760 --> 00:21:54,000
the military's mission to win?

305
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:02,200
Dad.

306
00:22:08,280 --> 00:22:09,760
You won't be disappointed, right?

307
00:22:13,360 --> 00:22:14,320
You will definitely

308
00:22:15,760 --> 00:22:17,440
support my choice, right?

309
00:22:19,960 --> 00:22:21,160
Esteemed Brigade Party Committee,

310
00:22:22,800 --> 00:22:24,080
a philosopher once said,

311
00:22:25,560 --> 00:22:27,920
eradicating old concepts from a person's mind

312
00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:29,840
is much harder

313
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:31,400
than instilling new ones.

314
00:22:33,320 --> 00:22:35,000
Some of my habitual ways of thinking

315
00:22:35,440 --> 00:22:36,920
are no longer suited for

316
00:22:37,560 --> 00:22:39,440
the new developments in the military.

317
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:41,360
Therefore,

318
00:22:42,040 --> 00:22:42,800
leaving

319
00:22:43,760 --> 00:22:45,400
and stepping down from my position

320
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:47,880
should currently be

321
00:22:48,320 --> 00:22:49,240
the greatest contribution

322
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:51,920
I can make to the troops.

323
00:22:53,120 --> 00:22:54,120
I ask the organization

324
00:22:54,800 --> 00:22:56,200
to approve my application.

325
00:22:57,200 --> 00:22:58,160
Suo Jian'an

326
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:20,440
Do you know why?

327
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:23,320
Even knowing that you and Deputy Brigade Commander Suo

328
00:23:23,320 --> 00:23:24,200
have some friction,

329
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:25,960
why would they still let him

330
00:23:26,600 --> 00:23:27,840
shadow the Wind Rider Battalion's every move?

331
