To tell you the truth,

332
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:32,960
this arrangement

333
00:23:33,600 --> 00:23:35,440
was personally proposed by Deputy Army Commander Liang.

334
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:38,720
Some say

335
00:23:39,520 --> 00:23:40,720
character determines destiny.

336
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:42,400
But as for you,

337
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:45,400
every one of us leaders

338
00:23:45,720 --> 00:23:47,680
refuses to let personality flaws

339
00:23:48,280 --> 00:23:49,760
ruin such a promising prospect.

340
00:23:52,040 --> 00:23:52,600
I apologize.

341
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,760
I've caused the leaders so much trouble.

342
00:23:57,200 --> 00:23:57,840
Deputy Army Commander Liang

343
00:23:57,840 --> 00:23:59,840
had Comrade Suo Jian'an keep an eye on you

344
00:24:00,720 --> 00:24:01,880
because he hoped he

345
00:24:02,480 --> 00:24:04,880
could help you overcome your personality flaws,

346
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:07,240
and properly temper and refine you.

347
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:10,160
Only then can you achieve great things.

348
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:12,720
And Comrade Suo Jian'an

349
00:24:13,800 --> 00:24:14,800
was willing to play the bad guy.

350
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:17,320
His purpose

351
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:18,840
wasn't to target you.

352
00:24:18,840 --> 00:24:19,320
Rather,

353
00:24:20,840 --> 00:24:22,200
he wanted the Wind Rider Battalion

354
00:24:22,840 --> 00:24:24,320
to grow stronger sooner.

355
00:24:31,360 --> 00:24:32,240
Speaking of this,

356
00:24:33,160 --> 00:24:34,160
there is one thing

357
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:36,440
I must tell you clearly.

358
00:25:00,920 --> 00:25:02,200
This is Comrade Suo Jian'an's

359
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:03,680
personally submitted

360
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:06,320
investigation report on the allegations against you.

361
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:17,840
After a comprehensive investigation,

362
00:25:18,440 --> 00:25:19,760
I guarantee on my Party spirit that

363
00:25:20,840 --> 00:25:22,080
Comrade Guo Zijian

364
00:25:22,720 --> 00:25:23,920
can withstand any test.

365
00:25:24,520 --> 00:25:25,840
He is politically reliable,

366
00:25:26,240 --> 00:25:27,600
financially incorruptible,

367
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:29,400
upright in character,

368
00:25:29,800 --> 00:25:30,840
and works well with his comrades.

369
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:32,920
This comrade

370
00:25:33,560 --> 00:25:36,720
possesses a unique and valuable sense of innovation,

371
00:25:37,800 --> 00:25:38,640
as well as decisive

372
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:40,640
and astute command abilities.

373
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:43,040
Although he has a strong personality,

374
00:25:43,560 --> 00:25:44,720
he dares to take responsibility.

375
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:47,160
Given time,

376
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,520
he will surely become,

377
00:25:49,040 --> 00:25:50,560
in the future development of the military,

378
00:25:51,120 --> 00:25:52,120
a rare and

379
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:54,000
outstanding talent.

380
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:55,720
Guo Zijian.

381
00:25:56,560 --> 00:25:57,320
Tell me the truth.

382
00:25:58,440 --> 00:25:59,320
Have you ever hated me?

383
00:26:01,800 --> 00:26:02,680
I wouldn't call it hate.

384
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:03,800
It's fine, speak freely.

385
00:26:04,720 --> 00:26:05,480
It's just that

386
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:08,320
I don't really like you.

387
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:12,040
Good kid.

388
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:13,680
Very honest.

389
00:26:16,120 --> 00:26:17,120
To be honest,

390
00:26:18,600 --> 00:26:19,920
I don't even know why myself,

391
00:26:20,840 --> 00:26:22,640
nor do I know when it started,

392
00:26:23,440 --> 00:26:23,960
but I

393
00:26:24,960 --> 00:26:26,480
just became old and sluggish.

394
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:28,200
When doing things,

395
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:30,120
I became indecisive

396
00:26:30,520 --> 00:26:31,560
and overly cautious.

397
00:26:31,920 --> 00:26:33,760
That's because the nature of your work is different,

398
00:26:33,760 --> 00:26:35,560
so the responsibilities you bear are also different.

399
00:26:35,680 --> 00:26:36,600
Not entirely.

400
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:40,440
You captured Long Yuanshan today,

401
00:26:42,040 --> 00:26:43,960
which really opened my eyes.

402
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:46,960
A lot of things I couldn't figure out before

403
00:26:46,960 --> 00:26:48,040
suddenly make sense now.

404
00:26:48,880 --> 00:26:51,040
You only live once, and chances to fight are rare.

405
00:26:51,840 --> 00:26:52,480
The key is

406
00:26:53,120 --> 00:26:54,720
to choose the right battlefield

407
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:57,080
and the right position.

408
00:26:57,720 --> 00:26:58,520
Otherwise,

409
00:26:59,080 --> 00:26:59,760
you'd just end up

410
00:27:00,800 --> 00:27:02,960
like Don Quixote tilting at windmills.

411
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:04,880
Deputy Army Commander Liang put it well.

412
00:27:05,800 --> 00:27:06,880
When the times eliminate someone,

413
00:27:08,320 --> 00:27:09,520
they don't even give a warning.

414
00:27:22,040 --> 00:27:22,480
Reporting.

415
00:27:23,040 --> 00:27:23,440
Come in.

416
00:27:27,840 --> 00:27:28,480
Sir.

417
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:29,320
You sent for me?

418
00:27:31,360 --> 00:27:33,360
Headquarters has issued a new exercise mission.

419
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:35,320
At...

420
00:27:35,720 --> 00:27:36,560
At a time like this?

421
00:27:36,840 --> 00:27:38,000
Yes, at a time like this.

422
00:27:40,600 --> 00:27:41,200
I know.

423
00:27:42,600 --> 00:27:44,040
What happened to Comrade Suo Jian'an

424
00:27:44,320 --> 00:27:45,600
has been a huge blow to everyone.

425
00:27:46,600 --> 00:27:47,320
But

426
00:27:47,840 --> 00:27:48,920
this exercise

427
00:27:49,280 --> 00:27:50,120
is extraordinary.

428
00:27:52,120 --> 00:27:53,040
On the surface,

429
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:55,680
it's a demonstrative training exercise.

430
00:27:56,480 --> 00:27:57,360
But in reality,

431
00:27:58,080 --> 00:27:59,560
it evaluates our new-type combat forces,

432
00:27:59,760 --> 00:28:01,160
testing their battlefield adaptability

433
00:28:01,280 --> 00:28:02,760
through a comprehensive, combat-oriented inspection.

434
00:28:03,640 --> 00:28:04,520
It seems

435
00:28:04,760 --> 00:28:06,440
the proof is in the pudding for Wind Rider Battalion.

436
00:28:07,240 --> 00:28:09,040
This time, they really have to prove it

437
00:28:09,200 --> 00:28:10,160
in front of the entire army.

438
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:11,000
Exactly.

439
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:13,520
And they'll be showing it to Army Headquarters leadership

440
00:28:13,840 --> 00:28:15,360
and various experts.

441
00:28:15,640 --> 00:28:16,520
I also heard

442
00:28:16,760 --> 00:28:18,360
that partner units for the new equipment

443
00:28:18,400 --> 00:28:19,560
have received invitations too.

444
00:28:20,120 --> 00:28:20,840
In short,

445
00:28:21,280 --> 00:28:22,120
it's quite a big deal.

446
00:28:24,680 --> 00:28:25,440
Sir,

447
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:27,720
I'm a little worried.

448
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:30,880
From Guo Zijian to Liang Hong,

449
00:28:31,280 --> 00:28:32,240
including Jiang Shengqiang,

450
00:28:32,840 --> 00:28:34,480
they are not in a good state of mind right now.

451
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:36,960
I know.

452
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:41,080
Dealing with a comrade's life and death

453
00:28:41,840 --> 00:28:43,440
is a difficult hurdle to overcome.

454
00:28:45,120 --> 00:28:46,240
It's not just them.

455
00:28:47,680 --> 00:28:50,040
Comrade Liu Wangyuan is also quite distressed.

456
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:52,440
But

457
00:28:53,440 --> 00:28:54,400
with a major battle imminent,

458
00:28:56,160 --> 00:28:57,360
this matter cannot be delayed.

459
00:28:57,760 --> 00:28:58,520
It needs to be resolved immediately.

460
00:28:58,840 --> 00:28:59,240
Yes, sir.

461
00:29:00,040 --> 00:29:01,640
I'll talk it over thoroughly with Old Kang,

462
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:02,880
and aim to get this resolved as soon as possible.

463
00:29:03,360 --> 00:29:03,680
Go on.

464
00:29:41,320 --> 00:29:41,960
Reporting.

465
00:29:42,760 --> 00:29:43,280
Sir.

466
00:29:43,520 --> 00:29:45,120
I have something to report to you.

467
00:29:46,680 --> 00:29:47,280
Come in.

468
00:29:48,040 --> 00:29:48,640
Come over here.

469
00:30:00,360 --> 00:30:00,880
Come in.

470
00:30:06,360 --> 00:30:07,200
Still haven't finished writing?

471
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:13,240
Sorry, my mind wandered again.

472
00:30:17,040 --> 00:30:17,920
Up all night again.

473
00:30:20,600 --> 00:30:21,640
I couldn't sleep at all.

474
00:30:28,720 --> 00:30:29,800
Some things

475
00:30:31,960 --> 00:30:32,840
you just have to move past.

476
00:30:37,800 --> 00:30:39,320
Have you moved past it?

477
00:30:50,640 --> 00:30:51,360
I've made up my mind.

478
00:31:02,800 --> 00:31:03,560
Actually,

479
00:31:04,480 --> 00:31:06,960
After your transfer, Comrade Suo Jian'an

480
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:09,360
once submitted a document to me.

481
00:31:10,400 --> 00:31:11,920
It detailed

482
00:31:12,800 --> 00:31:14,040
some of his thoughts on you.

483
00:31:15,800 --> 00:31:16,440
He said

484
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:20,400
you're actually a very well-rounded comrade.

485
00:31:21,160 --> 00:31:23,000
Your strengths aren't just reflected

486
00:31:23,360 --> 00:31:25,440
in administrative and logistics work.

487
00:31:26,600 --> 00:31:27,440
In military affairs,

488
00:31:28,440 --> 00:31:30,360
you also have great room for improvement.

489
00:31:32,600 --> 00:31:34,080
Although you have many shortcomings now,

490
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:36,840
you're very young and have potential.

491
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:39,080
He hoped our Brigade Party Committee

492
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:41,840
could give you a comprehensive evaluation.

493
00:31:43,760 --> 00:31:44,760
He hoped

494
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:46,240
you could develop better.

495
00:31:53,160 --> 00:31:54,640
Lao Suo's sacrifice

496
00:31:55,080 --> 00:31:57,800
has had a massive impact on everyone.

497
00:31:59,200 --> 00:31:59,920
But,

498
00:32:00,800 --> 00:32:03,200
I hope you can step out of the shadows soon.

499
00:32:04,520 --> 00:32:07,040
The 396th Brigade needs core members like you.

500
00:32:11,800 --> 00:32:12,560
All these years,

501
00:32:13,840 --> 00:32:15,000
I've been calculating

502
00:32:15,880 --> 00:32:16,920
and scheming at every turn.

503
00:32:18,320 --> 00:32:20,200
I put all my focus on these things.

504
00:32:24,280 --> 00:32:26,120
Actually, before Deputy Brigade Commander Suo sacrificed himself,

505
00:32:27,360 --> 00:32:29,000
he repeatedly reminded me

506
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:32,720
and asked what my original aspiration as a soldier was.

507
00:32:36,600 --> 00:32:39,160
I always only told half the truth.

508
00:32:40,680 --> 00:32:41,240
What I said

509
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:43,960
was naturally just pretty words.

510
00:32:44,960 --> 00:32:45,560
Otherwise,

511
00:32:46,360 --> 00:32:48,120
why would everyone call me Scheming Liu?

512
00:32:51,960 --> 00:32:53,920
I failed to live up to your trust, Sir.

513
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:56,080
I failed

514
00:32:57,240 --> 00:32:58,640
my identity as a soldier.

515
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:00,680
Recognizing and correcting your mistakes

516
00:33:01,280 --> 00:33:02,200
is a good thing.

517
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:05,400
I'll hold on to this report for now.

518
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:06,880
Think it over again.

519
00:33:07,360 --> 00:33:08,280
Everything

520
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:10,080
can be decided after the exercise.

521
00:33:12,280 --> 00:33:13,720
Is there a new exercise mission?

522
00:33:14,160 --> 00:33:14,640
Yes.

523
00:33:14,920 --> 00:33:16,480
This time, it's in front of the whole army,

524
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:18,600
to test the 396th Brigade's reform results.

525
00:33:22,360 --> 00:33:22,880
Sir,

526
00:33:23,800 --> 00:33:24,720
I have a request.

527
00:33:26,360 --> 00:33:26,640
Speak.

528
00:33:28,040 --> 00:33:29,360
I want to participate in this exercise.

529
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:31,880
As an ordinary soldier.

530
00:33:35,600 --> 00:33:37,440
We can consider your request.

531
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:39,480
But the main forces this time

532
00:33:39,480 --> 00:33:41,040
are Wind Rider Battalion and Hurricane Battalion.

533
00:33:41,600 --> 00:33:43,520
As far as I know, you three...

534
00:33:43,520 --> 00:33:45,280
There are no issues between the three of us.

535
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:47,960
It's just that after this incident,

536
00:33:48,800 --> 00:33:49,640
at that time,

537
00:33:50,080 --> 00:33:51,200
I didn't know who to blame.

538
00:33:51,680 --> 00:33:52,600
I didn't know what to do.

539
00:33:54,200 --> 00:33:55,200
I just felt...

540
00:33:59,040 --> 00:33:59,800
I just felt

541
00:33:59,800 --> 00:34:01,440
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo shouldn't have left us like this.

542
00:34:05,120 --> 00:34:05,640
Indeed.

543
00:34:08,680 --> 00:34:10,440
But now a major battle is imminent.

544
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:11,760
Let alone you,

545
00:34:12,480 --> 00:34:14,120
even those two, including Liang Hong,

546
00:34:14,440 --> 00:34:16,120
haven't recovered their state of mind yet.

547
00:34:17,560 --> 00:34:18,800
I'm very worried.

548
00:34:20,120 --> 00:34:20,600
Brigade Commander,

549
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:22,480
if you still trust me,

550
00:34:23,520 --> 00:34:24,600
leave this matter to me.

551
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:27,280
Before Deputy Brigade Commander Suo passed away,

552
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:28,480
his biggest wish

553
00:34:29,280 --> 00:34:30,960
was to see those two

554
00:34:30,960 --> 00:34:32,160
fighting side by side.

555
00:34:34,920 --> 00:34:36,440
Let me help him fulfill this wish.

556
00:34:42,600 --> 00:34:43,560
I believe

557
00:34:44,400 --> 00:34:45,320
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo

558
00:34:45,520 --> 00:34:46,600
wasn't wrong about you.

559
00:35:30,120 --> 00:35:30,720
Actually,

560
00:35:33,160 --> 00:35:34,600
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo left us

561
00:35:36,840 --> 00:35:37,600
with no regrets.

562
00:35:39,000 --> 00:35:40,200
Because before he passed,

563
00:35:41,200 --> 00:35:42,600
he made the decision

564
00:35:43,600 --> 00:35:44,720
that he wanted to make.

565
00:35:46,640 --> 00:35:48,440
Even if this happened again,

566
00:35:49,320 --> 00:35:50,960
I can guarantee you this:

567
00:35:52,480 --> 00:35:54,040
even knowing the outcome,

568
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:55,760
he would still rush in.

569
00:35:57,400 --> 00:35:59,040
That's the brother I deeply respect.

570
00:36:00,200 --> 00:36:01,360
But rather than feeling sorrow,

571
00:36:01,880 --> 00:36:03,040
what takes more courage

572
00:36:05,600 --> 00:36:06,440
is facing it.

573
00:36:06,840 --> 00:36:07,320
Right?

574
00:36:09,080 --> 00:36:10,680
So we should look forward.

575
00:36:11,920 --> 00:36:13,280
We must look forward.

576
00:36:15,560 --> 00:36:16,760
In the past, I, Liu Wangyuan,

577
00:36:17,560 --> 00:36:18,880
did a lot of irresponsible things.

578
00:36:20,440 --> 00:36:22,720
But now I know what I must do,

579
00:36:22,840 --> 00:36:23,640
and how to do it.

580
00:36:27,160 --> 00:36:28,520
I won't let him down again.

581
00:36:32,760 --> 00:36:33,760
We're all soldiers,

582
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:35,520
